{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"91675bd5b2d9711b70f930e69360acefdcf124b7838fb9a2f645b99fff26f078","digest":{"component_or_area":"test_live_jira_dc_provisioning","key_entities":["tests/unit/test_live_jira_dc_provisioning.py:195","test_a_missing_epic_field_aborts_provisioning","scripts/jira_dc_field_readiness.py:114","FIELD_READY_BUDGET_S","FIELD_POLL_INTERVAL_S","JIRA_DC_FIELD_READY_TIMEOUT","await_required_fields","_assert_project_capabilities","/rest/api/2/field","Epic Link","Epic Name"],"problem_keywords":["test timeout","unit test performance","jira readiness poll","budget expiry","wall-clock delay"],"propositions":["test_a_missing_epic_field_aborts_provisioning sleeps for ~120 seconds because the stubbed /rest/api/2/field response lacks Epic Link, causing the readiness poll to exhaust FIELD_READY_BUDGET_S before terminating","the production constant FIELD_READY_BUDGET_S (120.0 seconds) is honored by await_required_fields and can only be overridden by setting JIRA_DC_FIELD_READY_TIMEOUT environment variable","with a zero budget the readiness loop makes exactly one poll attempt then breaks on monotonic() >= deadline before calling sleep, making the poll count deterministic rather than timing-dependent","setting JIRA_DC_FIELD_READY_TIMEOUT to zero via monkeypatch.setenv in the test will reduce execution from ~120s to <5ms and enable an exact one-poll assertion as a guard"]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787654904937813001,"uuid":"fd2932c4-a4b7-4ac8-9600-84086b81aa95"}